Troubleshooting Tips
Issue: Module import errors

Ensure all Python files are in the same directory
Check file names match import statements exactly
Issue: Pandas not found

Reinstall: pip3 install --user pandas tabulate
Verify: python3 -c "import pandas; print(pandas.__version__)"
Issue: Amount comparison fails

Use round() for floating-point comparisons
Consider tolerance levels: abs(a - b) < 0.01
Issue: Empty DataFrames

Verify CSV files exist: ls -la *.csv
Check CSV format and headers match code expectations
Print DataFrame after loading: print(df.head())
